Growing up at [[Rotterdam Orphanage]], this orphan would regularly bully [[Harrison Fears]] with the other orphans, which often resulted in fights with [[Den Fears]], who fought to protect his little brother and the other weaker kids at the orphanage. {{source|Den vs Harrison}}

When [[Tantras]] and the [[Blood Spiral]] came to the orphanage in search of recruits, he and the other orphans began training for them. {{source|Den vs Harrison}} 

This orphan was eventually enrolled into Tantras' class of students and was sent to eliminate Den for betraying the Blood Spiral. He restrained [[Dante Vale]] with [[Unnamed Orphan 005]] and both were ensnared in [[Tantras]]' [[Skingrip]] power who did not care about hitting them too with his [[Bladewave]]. He was blasted back as the spell was repelled by [[Sophie Casterwill]]'s [[Honorguard]] power. Tantras and his class then retreated after seeing Lok Lambert possessed a [[Lindorm|Powerbonded Titan]]. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}
